// Title: Arbitrary File Download Via Squirrel.EXE
// Rule ID: 1e75c1cc-c5d4-42aa-ac3d-91b0b68b3b4c
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.execution, attack.t1218
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_squirrel_download.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
